
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AI作文修改器</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f1f5f9;padding:18px;color:#1e293b}
.container{max-width:700px;margin:auto;background:white;padding:20px;border-radius:15px}
h1{text-align:center;color:#2563eb}
textarea{width:100%;height:260px;padding:12px;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:10px;font-size:16px}
button{background:#2563eb;color:white;border:0;padding:13px;border-radius:9px;width:100%;font-size:16px;margin-top:12px}
.result{background:#eff6ff;padding:15px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:15px;white-space:pre-wrap;line-height:1.7}
select{width:100%;padding:12px;margin:10px 0;border-radius:8px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<h1>AI作文修改器</h1>
<p>初中作文智能分析与修改工具</p>

<label>选择年级</label>
<select id="grade">
<option>初三</option>
<option>初二</option>
<option>初一</option>
</select>

<label>作文内容</label>
<textarea id="essay" placeholder="请粘贴你的作文……"></textarea>

<button onclick="reviewEssay()">开始修改作文</button>
<div id="result" class="result">修改结果将在这里显示。</div>
</div>

<script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
